{"speciesId":619,"names":{"fr":"Kungfouine","es":"Mienfoo","en":"Mienfoo","ja":"コジョフー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il découpe ses ennemis avec ses griffes acérées et les terrasse avec ses enchaînements de coups hyper fluides."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"In fights, they dominate with onslaughts of flowing, continuous attacks. With their sharp claws, they cut enemies."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il emploie des enchaînements élégants. Lorsqu’il se concentre, leur vitesse et leur tranchant augmentent."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"They have mastered elegant combos. As they concentrate, their battle moves become swifter and more precise."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It takes pride in the speed at which it can use moves. What it loses in power, it makes up for in quantity."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It takes pride in the speed at which it can use moves. What it loses in power, it makes up for in quantity."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il se flatte d’être très rapide. Pour compenser la faiblesse de ses coups, il en assène un très grand nombre."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"La velocidad de sus ataques es su gran orgullo. Lo que le falta de fuerza bruta lo compensa en cantidad de golpes."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It takes pride in the speed at which it can use moves. What it loses in power, it makes up for in quantity."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"技を繰り出す スピードが 自慢。 たとえ パワーは 低くても 手数の 多さで カバーする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il découpe ses ennemis avec ses griffes acérées et les terrasse avec ses enchaînements de coups hyper fluides."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Abruma a su rival con oleadas de ataques veloces. Corta al enemigo con sus afiladas garras."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"In fights, they dominate with onslaughts of flowing, continuous attacks. With their sharp claws, they cut enemies."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"流れるような 連続 攻撃を 繰り出して 敵を 圧倒する。 鋭い ツメで 敵を 切り裂く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il se flatte d’être très rapide. Pour compenser la faiblesse de ses coups, il en assène un très grand nombre."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"La velocidad de sus ataques es su gran orgullo. Lo que le falta de fuerza bruta lo compensa en cantidad de golpes."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It takes pride in the speed at which it can use moves. What it loses in power, it makes up for in quantity."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"技を繰り出す スピードが 自慢。 たとえ パワーは 低くても 手数の 多さで カバーする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il découpe ses ennemis avec ses griffes acérées et les terrasse avec ses enchaînements de coups hyper fluides."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Abruma a su rival con oleadas de ataques veloces. Corta al enemigo con sus afiladas garras."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"In fights, they dominate with onslaughts of flowing, continuous attacks. With their sharp claws, they cut enemies."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"流れるような 連続 攻撃を 繰り出して 敵を 圧倒する。 鋭い ツメで 敵を 切り裂く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Au petit jour, on peut voir des meutes de Kungfouine qui s’entraînent en effectuant des mouvements lents et méthodiques."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"A primera hora de la mañana pueden verse grupos de Mienfoo realizando movimientos lentos y adoptando distintas poses."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"They can often be seen in packs in the morning, slowly moving their bodies through a series of poses."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"朝に ゆっくりとした 動きで いろんな ポーズを とる 群れの 姿を 見ることが できるよ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il s’isole en montagne pour s’entraîner avec ses congénères. Les techniques de coups de pied ou de poing changent d’une meute à l’autre."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Suele recluirse con otros congéneres en las montañas para entrenar. Según el grupo, la técnica de sus patadas o puñetazos varía."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"They seclude themselves in the mountains and devote themselves to training. The form of their kicks and chops differs from pack to pack."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"山奥に こもり 群れの 仲間と 修行に 励む。 群れによって キックや チョップの型が 違う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Les Kungfouine bien entraînés sont capables d’asséner plus de cent coups par minute du tranchant de la main."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Un Mienfoo bien entrenado es capaz de propinar más de cien golpes por minuto."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"In one minute, a well-trained Mienfoo can chop with its arms more than 100 times."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"よく鍛えられた コジョフーは １分で １００回を 超える チョップを 打つことが できる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"De nature brutale malgré sa petite taille, il inflige une série de coups majestueux aux inconscients qui s’approchent trop près de lui."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su apariencia menuda contrasta con su carácter poco afable. Abruma a los rivales que se acercan a él con gráciles oleadas de ataques sucesivos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Though small, Mienfoo’s temperament is fierce. Any creature that approaches Mienfoo carelessly will be greeted with a flurry of graceful attacks."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"小さくても 気性は 荒い。 油断して 近づく 相手には 華麗な 連打を おみまいする。"}],"varieties":[{"id":619,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"double-slap","learns":[[11,"level-up",17],[14,"level-up",17],[15,"level-up",17],[16,"level-up",17],[17,"level-up",17],[18,"level-up",17]]},{